demonstrated_outcomes[4]:
  - id: out-01
    achievement: Designed and built an E2E test automation framework from scratch for desktop applications developed in Delphi.
    context: "The quality team spent a significant amount of time on regression testing: one or two QA professionals per product could spend almost an entire day ensuring regression coverage. The goal was to reduce spending on paid tools and free up time for more productive activities, while maintaining quality assurance. I conceived, planned, presented, and built a framework to address this problem."
    implementation: "The framework was developed with Python and Robot Framework, using reusable components, Page Object Model, tags, custom libraries, and custom keywords. The automated test suite was integrated into pipelines with Bitbucket Pipelines/Runner, and results were published on internal HTTP servers (Nginx)."
    impact[3]: Reduced regression testing time from an average of six hours of manual work by one or more QA professionals to approximately one hour.,Made regression testing less exhausting and more reliable. The framework was adopted by the team and gave several professionals their first hands-on experience with automation.,Three QA engineers went on to develop automation for other systems and contribute to improvements to the project.
    source_achievements[2]: sr-01,sr-02
  - id: out-02
    achievement: "Took ownership of the architecture and technical leadership of a Cypress and JavaScript automation project, expanding the suite from approximately 50 to over 400 E2E tests."
    context: "I started by contributing to test creation and maintenance. After the senior engineer responsible for the project left, I progressively took ownership of its architecture and technical leadership. During my involvement, the suite grew from approximately 50 to 400 E2E tests in Cypress with JavaScript."
    implementation: "Implemented Page Object Model, custom commands, tag-based execution, test data, Data-Driven Testing, multi-environment configuration, dynamic waits, and automated restoration of the baseline state."
    impact[3]: "Restored the reliability of a project that had become fragile, making its reports more consistent with the actual state of the product.","Made test maintenance and ongoing test creation easier, allowing more time to be spent creating new tests rather than just fixing existing ones.",Tests ran overnight and supported decisions about release quality.
    source_achievements[1]: qa-01
  - id: out-03
    achievement: Developed and improved pipelines integrated into the CI/CD workflow to run test projects automatically.
    context: "Developed and fixed Jenkins pipelines integrated into the CI/CD workflow, as well as pipelines using Bitbucket Pipelines/Runner. I was responsible for keeping the suites runnable, configuring and maintaining the environment, generating Allure reports, and publishing results via SSH or WinSCP to internal HTTP servers (Apache/Nginx)."
    impact[3]: Centralized results in Allure reports published on HTTP servers.,Provided faster feedback on release quality and an overall view of the state of the product.,Reduced reliance on informal communication about failures and made defect investigation and validation easier.
    source_achievements[2]: sr-02,dv-01
  - id: out-04
    achievement: Automated the setup of Windows desktop test runners with a Python and PowerShell solution.
    context: "The solution installed and configured the entire stack required to run tests in pipelines, including Bitbucket Runner, Java, WinSCP, Allure Report, Git, PostgreSQL, the product under test, and the PowerShell scripts needed for automated execution."
    implementation: "Organized dependencies into modules, ensured idempotency, handled potential execution edge cases, and documented why each component of the stack was needed. Used AI (Gemini) to help create the scripts."
    impact[2]: "Reduced manual effort by 80% and consolidated the procedure for reproducing the environment, reducing reliance on undocumented, highly specific knowledge. The solution was designed to make future setup easier for other professionals.","Automated much of the required setup, which could take 5 hours or more of manual work and require specific knowledge of several tools."
    source_achievements[1]: sr-03
